Phosphor BASIC 0.0.1 -- REPL. Variables and functions persist across lines.
Type a multi-line block and it waits for the terminator. Ctrl+Z then Enter to quit.
phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor>      ...>      ...> for 1
for 2
for 3
phosphor> phosphor>      ...>      ...>      ...> while 1
while 2
phosphor> phosphor>      ...>      ...>      ...> wend 1
wend 2
phosphor> phosphor>      ...>      ...>      ...> do 1
do 2
phosphor> phosphor>      ...>      ...>      ...> repeat 1
repeat 2
phosphor>      ...>      ...>      ...>      ...>      ...> select right
phosphor>      ...>      ...>      ...>      ...>      ...> two-word right
phosphor> phosphor>      ...>      ...>      ...>      ...> nested 1
nested 2
